function cashMovement(){formModal('Record cash in / out',selectField('Direction','direction',[['in','Cash in'],['out','Cash out']])+field('Amount','amount','text','','required inputmode="decimal"')+field('Reason','reason','text','','required')+approval(),async data=>{const form=$('#modal-form');form.dataset.requestKey ||= key();await api('/cash-movements','POST',{...data,request_key:form.dataset.requestKey,amount_minor:minor(data.amount)});closeModal();await renderShifts();toast('Cash movement recorded.');},'Record cash');}
async function returnSale(sid){const r=await api('/sales/'+sid);const available=r.lines.filter(l=>l.quantity>l.returned_quantity);requireClient(available.length,'All items from this sale have already been returned or voided.');formModal('Return or void sale',`<div class="notice field full">${e(r.sale.receipt_number)} · Refunds are paid from your current open shift.</div>`+selectField('Correction type','correction_type',[['return','Return selected items'],['void','Void the entire sale']])+`<div class="field full"><div class="refund-line"><strong>Item</strong><small>Return qty</small><small>Restock qty</small></div>${available.map(l=>`<div class="refund-line"><div>${e(l.description_snapshot)}<small>${l.quantity-l.returned_quantity} remaining · ${money(l.unit_price_minor)} each</small></div><input aria-label="Return quantity for ${e(l.description_snapshot)}" type="number" name="qty-${l.sale_line_id}" value="0" min="0" max="${l.quantity-l.returned_quantity}" step="1"><input aria-label="Restock quantity for ${e(l.description_snapshot)}" type="number" name="restock-${l.sale_line_id}" value="0" min="0" max="${l.quantity-l.returned_quantity}" step="1"></div>`).join('')}<small>Only restock sellable items. A void must include every sold item.</small></div>`+field('Reason','reason','text','','required')+approval(),async data=>{const form=$('#modal-form');form.dataset.requestKey ||= key();const lines=available.filter(l=>Number(data['qty-'+l.sale_line_id])>0).map(l=>({sale_line_id:l.sale_line_id,quantity:Number(data['qty-'+l.sale_line_id]),restock_quantity:Number(data['restock-'+l.sale_line_id])}));const result=await api('/sales/'+sid+'/corrections','POST',{...data,request_key:form.dataset.requestKey,lines});closeModal();await loadCatalog();await showReceipt(sid);toast('Correction recorded'+(result.refund_minor?': '+money(result.refund_minor)+' refunded.':'.'));},'Record correction',true);}
async function renderTeam(){const {users,terminals}=await api('/team');S.team=users;$('#page').innerHTML=heading('A counter with your people.','Named accounts and approved laptops keep every action accountable.',button('Add account','new-user','green','plus'))+`<div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Accounts</h2><span class="muted">Passwords are never displayed</span></div>${table(['Person','Username','Role','Status',''],users.map(u=>`<tr><td><strong>${e(u.display_name)}</strong></td><td class="mono">${e(u.username)}</td><td>${e(u.role)}</td><td>${pill(u.active?'Active':'Disabled',u.active?'success':'warn')}</td><td>${button('Manage','edit-user','light','edit',`data-id="${u.user_id}"`)}</td></tr>`))}</div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Laptops</h2><span class="muted">Sign in on Laptop 2 to request approval</span></div>${table(['Laptop','Last sign-in','Access',''],terminals.map(t=>`<tr><td>${icon('laptop')} ${e(t.name)}</td><td>${e(timestamp(t.last_seen_at))}</td><td>${pill(t.approved?'Approved':'Waiting for approval',t.approved?'success':'warn')}</td><td>${button(t.approved?'Manage':'Approve','manage-terminal','light','shield',`data-id="${t.terminal_id}" data-name="${e(t.name)}" data-approved="${t.approved}"`)}</td></tr>`))}</div>`;}
function userForm(uid){const u=S.team?.find(u=>u.user_id===uid);formModal(u?'Manage account':'Create an account',field('Display name','display_name','text',u?.display_name||'','required')+(u?`<div class="field"><label>Username</label><input value="${e(u.username)}" disabled></div>`:field('Username','username','text','','required minlength="3" maxlength="50"'))+selectField('Role','role',[['cashier','Cashier'],['manager','Manager']],u?.role||'cashier')+selectField('Status','active',[['true','Active'],['false','Disabled']],String(u?!!u.active:true))+`<div class="field full"><label for="f-password">${u?'New password (leave blank to keep current)':'Password'}</label><input type="password" name="password" id="f-password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" ${u?'':'required'}></div>`+approval(),async data=>{await api(u?'/users/'+uid:'/users',u?'PUT':'POST',{...data,active:data.active==='true'});closeModal();await renderTeam();toast('Account saved.');},'Save account');}
function terminalForm(buttonNode){const tid=Number(buttonNode.dataset.id);formModal('Manage laptop',field('Laptop name','name','text',buttonNode.dataset.name,'required')+selectField('Checkout access','approved',[['true','Approved'],['false','Revoked']],String(buttonNode.dataset.approved==='1'))+approval(),async data=>{await api('/terminals/'+tid,'PUT',{...data,approved:data.approved==='true'});closeModal();await renderTeam();toast('Laptop access updated.');},'Save laptop');}
async function renderAudit(){const {events}=await api('/audit');$('#page').innerHTML=heading('The details stay with you.','An append-only record of who did what, and when.',button('Refresh','refresh-page','light','refresh'))+`<div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Audit trail</h2><span class="muted">Latest 500 events</span></div>${events.length?table(['Time','Person / laptop','Action','Record','Reason / details'],events.map(a=>`<tr><td>${e(timestamp(a.created_at))}</td><td>${e(a.display_name||a.attempted_username||'System')}<br><small class="muted">${e(a.terminal_name||'—')}</small></td><td class="mono">${e(a.action)}</td><td>${e(a.entity_type)} ${e(a.entity_key||'')}</td><td class="audit-reason">${e(a.reason||'—')}${a.after_json?`<br>${button('Details','audit-details','light small','',`data-id="${a.audit_event_id}"`)}`:''}</td></tr>`)):empty('A record from the start','Activity will appear here as your team uses the counter.')}</div>`;S.auditEvents=events;}
async function renderSettings(){const data=await api('/backups');$('#page').innerHTML=heading('A few things behind the counter.','Your bazaar, business day, and recovery copies.')+`<div class="two-col"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Bazaar settings</h2>${pill('Local workspace')}</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>${e(S.bazaar.name)}</h3><p>${e(S.bazaar.currency_code)} · ${e(S.bazaar.timezone)}</p></div></div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>${S.day?'Day '+S.day.day_number+' is open':'No day is open'}</h3><p>${S.day?e(S.day.business_date)+' · Close all shifts and tickets before closing the day.':'Open the next business day to start trading.'}</p></div>${button(S.day?'Close day':'Open day',S.day?'close-day':'open-day','light','sun')}</div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>Cash checkout</h3><p>Whole units. No discounts or added tax configured.<br>Print format follows your browser and receipt printer.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Backups</h2>${button('Back up now','backup','green','download')}</div><div class="panel-body"><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>Online snapshot, verified after creation</h3><p>Every 15 minutes while the server is running, at day close, and on request. Keep a copy on a separate drive.</p></div></div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>Backup folder</h3><p class="mono">${e(data.directory)}</p></div></div><div class="setting-row"><div><h3>Restore with the server stopped</h3><p>Follow docs/operations.md. Restore into a new data folder, verify it, then switch the server to that folder.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h2>Recent backup runs</h2><span class="muted">No automatic deletion</span></div>${data.backups.length?table(['Started','Result','Verified','File'],data.backups.map(b=>`<tr><td>${e(timestamp(b.started_at))}</td><td>${pill(b.status,b.status==='verified'?'success':'error')}</td><td>${e(timestamp(b.verified_at))}</td><td class="audit-reason">${e(b.error_message||b.destination||'—')}</td></tr>`)):empty('Your first recovery copy','Create a backup after adding your opening catalog.','backup','Create backup')}</div>`;}
function managerAction(title,description,path){formModal(title,`<div class="field full"><small>${e(description)}</small></div>`+approval(),async data=>{const result=await api(path,'POST',data);closeModal();await boot();await navigate('settings');toast(result.backup?.status==='failed'?'Day closed, but backup failed. Check Settings.':path==='/backups'?'Backup verified.':'Operation completed.',result.backup?.status==='failed');},title);}

document.addEventListener('click',async ev=>{
  const target=ev.target.closest('button,[data-page],[data-category]');if(!target)return;
  try{
    if(target.dataset.page){if(S.paying)return;await cartQueue;return await navigate(target.dataset.page);}
    if(target.dataset.category){S.category=target.dataset.category;renderCategories();renderProducts();return;}
    if(target.dataset.add){await addProduct(Number(target.dataset.add));return;}
    if(target.dataset.qty){await addProduct(Number(target.dataset.qty),Number(target.dataset.delta));return;}
    if(target.dataset.cash){$('#amount-paid').value=(Number(target.dataset.cash)/100).toFixed(2);$('#amount-paid').dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));return;}
    const action=target.dataset.action;if(!action)return;
    const id=Number(target.dataset.id);
    const actions={
      'close-modal':closeModal,'boot':boot,'open-day':openDay,'open-shift':openShift,'close-shift':closeShift,'pay':paymentModal,
      'cancel-ticket':cancelTicket,'transfer-ticket':transferTicket,'new-product':()=>productForm(),'edit-product':()=>productForm(id),'new-stock':stockForm,'cash-movement':cashMovement,
      'new-user':()=>userForm(),'edit-user':()=>userForm(id),'manage-terminal':()=>terminalForm(target),'manager-close-shift':()=>managerCloseShift(id),
      'view-receipt':()=>showReceipt(id),'return-sale':()=>returnSale(id),
      'refresh-page':()=>navigate(S.page),'refresh-catalog':async()=>{await cartQueue;await refreshState();await renderCheckout();},
      'clear-filters':async()=>{S.filters={};await navigate(S.page);},
      'logout':async()=>{await cartQueue;await api('/logout','POST',{});S.ticket=null;S.cart=[];S.page='checkout';await boot();},
      'new-category':()=>formModal('Add a category',field('Category name','name','text','','required'),async data=>{await api('/categories','POST',data);closeModal();await renderCatalog();toast('Category added.');},'Add category'),
      'close-day':()=>managerAction('Close bazaar day','All shifts and open tickets must be closed. A backup runs after the day closes.','/days/close'),
      'backup':()=>managerAction('Create backup','Create and verify a snapshot of the live database, including product images.','/backups'),
      'print-receipt':()=>formModal('Print or save this receipt',field('Reason','reason','text','Customer copy','required'),async data=>{await api('/sales/'+id+'/reprint','POST',data);await showReceipt(id);window.print();},'Continue to print'),
      'audit-details':()=>{const a=S.auditEvents.find(a=>a.audit_event_id===id);modal('Audit event #'+id,`<div class="stack"><p><strong>${e(a.action)}</strong> · ${e(timestamp(a.created_at))}</p><p>${e(a.reason||'')}</p><label class="field">Before<textarea readonly rows="5">${e(a.before_json?JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(a.before_json),null,2):'—')}</textarea></label><label class="field">After<textarea readonly rows="8">${e(a.after_json?JSON.stringify(JSON.parse(a.after_json),null,2):'—')}</textarea></label></div>`);}
    };
    if(actions[action])await actions[action]();
  }catch(error){toast(error.message,true);}
});
document.addEventListener('change',async ev=>{if(ev.target.dataset.filter){S.filters[ev.target.dataset.filter]=ev.target.value;await navigate(S.page);}});
document.addEventListener('keydown',ev=>{if(ev.key==='Escape'){closeModal();}if(ev.key==='/'&&!['INPUT','TEXTAREA','SELECT'].includes(document.activeElement.tagName)){ev.preventDefault();$('#product-search')?.focus();}if(ev.key==='Tab'&&$('.modal')){const focusables=$$('button:not(:disabled),input:not(:disabled),select,textarea,a[href]',$('.modal'));const first=focusables[0],last=focusables.at(-1);if(ev.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){ev.preventDefault();last.focus();}else if(!ev.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){ev.preventDefault();first.focus();}}});
setInterval(async()=>{if(pollBusy||S.paying||document.hidden)return;pollBusy=true;try{const old=JSON.stringify([S.user?.user_id,S.terminal?.approved,S.day?.bazaar_day_id,S.shift?.shift_id]);const result=await refreshState();const next=JSON.stringify([result.user?.user_id,result.terminal?.approved,result.day?.bazaar_day_id,result.shift?.shift_id]);if(old!==next&&!$('.modal'))await boot();}catch{}finally{pollBusy=false;}},20000);
boot();
